  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and cook until the onion is softened, about 8 minutes.",
    "Add the celeriac, potatoes, caraway seeds, allspice, and thyme. Cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the beef broth and red wine (if using). Bring to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Season with black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
